**Vicious Hag** | Unaligned Power | Limited
__Basics__
The Vicious Hag must live win with a solo team. Every other night, the Hag may choose to attack a player.
__Details__
The Vicious Hag wins if they survive until the end of the game and if a solo team wins the game.
If a Solo player uses a power on the Vicious Hag, the Vicious Hag learns their identity. If they attempt to kill the Vicious Hag, the attack fails.
During the night, the Vicious Hag may choose to attack a player. They may not attack in consecutive nights.
Attacking a player is an immediate ability.
If the last solo role dies, the Hag turns into a solo role, becoming a bitter hag.

__Simplified__
The Vicious Hag must live win with a solo team. During the night, the Vicious Hag may choose to protect a player.
The Vicious Hag learns of solo powers being used on it, and cannot be killed by solo roles.
If the last solo role dies, the Vicious Hag becomes a bitter hag.

